// ============================================================================
// NovaX Orchestrator — The Complete AI OS Gateway
// Port: 9999 | 100% Ternary Native | Zero Python
// ============================================================================
// The orchestrator is the single gateway for all NovaX services.
// It boots services, monitors health, proxies requests, and serves the UI.
//
// Ternary states:
//   +1 = all services healthy, fleet running
//    0 = partial — some services degraded
//   -1 = critical — fleet failure
//
// 3-5-7-13 Harmonics:
//   Health check interval: H3 seconds (3s)
//   Service boot delay: H5 * 100ms (500ms between services)
//   Max retry count: H7 (7 retries)
//   Fleet timeout: H13 seconds (13s)
// ============================================================================

